        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-125385-125470"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125388-125421"><rb>毛莨</rb><rt>うまのあしがた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125421-125442">、貧しいうかれ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125442-125454"><rb>女</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125454-125470">の金貨。</seg></p>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-125470-125711"><seg source="#source-125470-125503">鈴蘭、おめかしの好な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125503-125521"><rb>女</rb><rt>をんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125521-125530">、白い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125530-125545"><rb>喉</rb><rt>のど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125545-125563">を見せて歩く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125563-125593"><rb>蓮葉者</rb><rt>はすはもの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125593-125596">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125596-125614"><rb>故意</rb><rt>わざ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125614-125644">とらしいあどけなさ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125644-125671"><rb>丸裸</rb><rt>まるはだか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125671-125674">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-125674-125704"><rb>罔象女</rb><rt>みづはのめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-125704-125711">。</seg></p>
